#use(std/xref)

A root #ref{VM} is case-insensitive and resolves the root def.

We define #def("VM"){virtual machine}{a sandboxed execution environment}.

Plurals via alias: a #ref("vms") and a #ref(to: "vm"){custom VM text}.

#defalias("vm" "vms")

#xref-scope(name: "api" ref-class: "api")
	Inside the scope, #ref{vm} shadows to the local def.

	#def("vm"){API virtual machine}{the scoped meaning}

	A scoped alias: #ref("vm-alias").

	#defalias("vm" "vm-alias")

Back at root, #ref{vm} resolves the root def again.

Root glossary:

#glossary

Scoped glossary:

#glossary(scope: "api")
